      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That's a really strong start, it definitely hits that epic tone I'm looking for. I want to make sure it feels authoritative so visitors really feel the weight of that era. Can you expand on that a bit? Maybe add a few more sentences that emphasize how this expansion was a necessary and glorious step in building the nation we are today.",
